PASS S3 10a: BC - AD = u1u2u3 * x(1-x^2)
PASS S3 10a: B = -u2 x < 0 on (0, oo) and D/B = 1
PASS S3 10a: on x = 0, xdot = alpha3 = c3 u3 > 0
